{"suttaId":"thag8.3","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2183,2211],"vripara":"510"},"segments":{"thag8.3:0.4":"Mahāpanthakattheragāthā","thag8.3:1.1":"“Yadā paṭhamamaddakkhiṃ, satthāramakutobhayaṃ;","thag8.3:1.3":"Tato me ahu saṃvego, passitvā purisuttamaṃ.","thag8.3:2.1":"“Siriṃ hatthehi pādehi, yo paṇāmeyya āgataṃ;","thag8.3:2.3":"Etādisaṃ so satthāraṃ, ārādhetvā virādhaye.","thag8.3:3.1":"“Tadāhaṃ puttadārañca, dhanadhaññañca chaḍḍayiṃ;","thag8.3:3.3":"Kesamassūni chedetvā, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thag8.3:4.1":"“Sikkhāsājīvasampanno, indriyesu susaṃvuto;","thag8.3:4.3":"Namassamāno sambuddhaṃ, vihāsiṃ aparājito.","thag8.3:5.1":"“Tato me paṇidhī āsi, cetaso abhipatthito;","thag8.3:5.3":"Na nisīde muhuttampi, taṇhāsalle anūhate.","thag8.3:6.1":"“Tassa mevaṃ viharato, passa vīriyaparakkamaṃ;","thag8.3:6.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thag8.3:7.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thag8.3:7.3":"Arahā dakkhiṇeyyomhi, vippamutto nirūpadhi.","thag8.3:8.1":"“Tato ratyā vivasāne [vivasane (sī. syā.)], sūriyassuggamanaṃ pati;","thag8.3:8.3":"Sabbaṃ taṇhaṃ visosetvā, pallaṅkena upāvisin”ti.","thag8.3:8.5":"… Mahāpanthako thero ….","thag8.3:8.6":"Aṭṭhakanipāto niṭṭhito.","thag8.3:9.0":"Tatruddānaṃ –","thag8.3:9.1":"Mahākaccāyano thero, sirimitto mahāpanthako;","thag8.3:9.3":"Ete aṭṭhanipātamhi, gāthāyo catuvīsatīti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
